      "content": "everything feels so pointless. like even if i try a new therapy or a new hobby, i'm just delaying the inevitable. it's like i'm just a person who is designed to fail. i'm so tired of fighting just to end up in the same dark place every single month. why is the struggle even worth it if the outcome is always the same? it feels like there is no actual way out of the loop except for... just letting it all end.",
